只觉得心烦，随口说：“晚上有应酬。”颜如玉很识大体：“那算了，你忙吧，我自己过去看看爸爸妈妈好了，晚上跟他们一起吃饭。”“那好。”季江然简单说了一句，将电话挂断。颜如玉在季家很吃得开，她嘴巴甜，又有眼力见，上流社会的那点儿精髓被她领悟得透彻。每次去季家都能将简白哄得眉开眼笑，一早就认定她是季家板上钉钉的儿媳妇了。这一点顾浅凝远不及她，以前就笨，用简白的话说，空有一副好皮囊，实则脑子缺弦。如今这个倒是不缺了，又冷冰冰的。主要是坏印象烙下了，怎么看着都烦。顾浅凝不急不缓的吃过午餐，去人才市场转了一圈。还没想好要找什么工作，不过看一下如今的人才需求，心里有个数。实在让人绝望，顾浅凝这个资质，拿着简历只怕去哪一家，连面试的机会都不会给。出来后，已经快下午三点了，看时间不早了。给顾夫人打电话，催促她：“妈，你出发了吗？”顾夫人支吾了一下；“那个浅凝啊，今天下午妈不能陪你逛街了，你妹她从学校回来了……我得在家陪她……”顾浅凝被放鸽子心情烦燥，这个顾家说不出怎么，就像哪里有猫腻。奈何顾浅凝脑子里的余印象并没有标识这一些，所以一切都隐隐说不清楚。冷冷说：“来不了算了。”顾夫人明显听出她生气了，低声说：“改天妈给你打电话，到时候去商场多给你买几件衣服，我付款。”顾浅凝回家的时候先去超市买生活用品和食材填充冰箱，回去的时候车子打市中心过，堵得要命，走走停停，打着方向盘心焦不已。随手将音乐打开，撑着脑袋静心聆听。忽然车子被撞击，猛然向前耸动。顾浅凝自镜中看了一眼，有一辆黑色轿车明显想要超车，却不小心刮了她的车尾一下。她将车子打到路边，开门下来。那黑色轿车的主人也下来了。火气很大，趾高气扬，指着顾浅凝就骂：“你没长眼睛是不是？”男人五大三粗，脸红脖子粗的骂人，还有点儿吓人。若是一般的女人只怕就不敢出声了。逼近后，问顾浅凝；“你打算怎么赔？”顾浅凝瞄了他的车子一眼，都没太有大碍，不过划掉一条漆。提醒他：“是你想超车撞到了我，责任不在我，你想让我怎么赔？”不远处一部商务车停下，一位好心的司机看到事故发生，过来帮忙。边走边问：“怎么了？”肇事司机没理会，瞪直了眼睛：“你说什么？是我的责任？你一个小姑娘眼瞎了是不是？”说话间拳头已经抡过来，朝顾浅凝砸上去。男子倒吸一口冷气，不等走近来帮忙。肇事司机的手臂已经被顾浅凝云淡风轻的攥在手里。眸光一闪，反倒笑了：“你还想动手么？冲动是魔鬼，你这样可不好。”她浅笑盈盈的说话，攥着肇事司机的那只手掌没有松开，就见男子渐渐露出痛苦狰狞的神色，整张脸都渐渐扭曲变型。隐忍着不发出声音，身姿却一再再下弯，仿佛痛不可遏，浑浊的气息呼呼的喷薄到顾浅凝的脸上。顾浅凝笑起来，哼了声：“原来你喝酒了，难怪这么狂妄。我是不打算赔你一毛钱，好啊，我们打电话报警，不要说责任不在我，就算真的在我，最厉害不过罚几个钱作罢。但你这个醉驾大发了，行政责任跟刑事责任可不一样。看你开这么好的车，人模狗样的混的该不错，人生路上抹上一笔黑，可不好看了。”肇事司机有些慌了神。而且两辆车子停的时间不短了，再算上好心人的那一辆，堪称壮观。唯怕将交警招过来，氛围缓和了一下，知道求饶了。“小姑娘，你先松开，咱们有话好好说。”顾浅凝眯起眼睛，凉凉说：“之前我想好好说的时候你不肯，现在姑奶奶不想了。是报警还是赔钱，你选一个？”肇事司机连连点头：“赔偿赔偿……你先放开我。”好心司机在一旁看着好奇，顾浅凝一脸平静，不相信一个小姑娘有多大的力道，男子何故连脸色都变了？顾浅凝一下甩开他的手臂，伸出手：“拿来。”肇事司机骤然变了脸色，翻脸不想认帐。“你休想。”顾浅凝反手就是一巴掌，已经爽快地打了上去。即便到了这个时候，天气仍旧不凉爽，头顶花白的一片光，晒得头皮冒油。之前堵了太长时间的车，本来都十分火大。这一刹再遭人讹诈，莫说多烦躁了这一巴掌用了几成力气，将人打懵了，耳畔嗡嗡的响。一侧脸颊火辣辣的疼起来，男子无论如何没想到一个女人的手劲能有这么大的威力。一抬首对上顾浅凝眸子的冷郁与噬血，吓得一个抖擞。再联想之前的不能反抗，即便喝得五迷三道，也该意识到此人不简单。马上掏出钱夹给钱，将三张百元大钞塞到顾浅凝的手里。要走，又被顾浅凝拉住。好笑：“你打发乞丐呢？给三百就想走，这三百给你买棺材差不多，修理我的车子却不够。”男子真慌了，又掏出一沓，数也没数，估计要有千数块，逃也似的离开了。顾浅凝志得满满，今天想来算是撞大运，出门竟碰土财主，之前吃饭有人追着付款，如今才到超市消费了一下，转眼就见回头钱。好心司机本来是要帮忙，却没能插得上手。这一会儿也有些看傻了眼。顾浅凝转首看过来，展颜一笑，没想到这个社会还有这样热心肠的人。当即抽出三百块往司机手里一塞，豪爽说；“请你喝酒。”接着转身上车，开走了。老司机握着那三百块回车里，觉得手里发热，转身将钱交公。“季总，大少奶奶给的钱，给您吧。”神色辗转反侧了一下，笑着说：“大少奶奶真是豪爽的一个人，胆子也大。”季江影若有所思的眯着眼，没什么情绪的说：“既然是大少奶奶给你的，拿着吧。”司机不敢收着：“您让我帮大少奶奶解围，我也没帮上一点儿忙，大少奶奶好胆识，将那个男人制得心服口服，还得了不少赔偿呢。”季江影没说话，他坐在车里，什么都看到了。隔得不远，还开着窗子，连顾浅凝的话他都听得一清二楚。以为她会吓哭，那个草包女人……只怕大庭广众闹出笑话，会被媒体大做文章丢他的脸。这样的结果，倒是没想到。看到顾浅凝开着敞篷跑车扬长而去，一头海澡般的长发随风舞动，竟是动人心魄的。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/chongshengzhihaomenhannu/7.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "The First Class of Spring Breeze (008) Touching Gu Qian Ning Ji Jiangran only smiled bitterly; \"Gu Qian Ning, did you take the wrong medicine? What on earth has happened to you? Do I want to make you so unwelcome?\" Gu Qian Ning's stomach was empty and she just wanted to eat. She glanced at him lightly and already ordered food from the waiter, as well as a bottle of valuable dry red. Then he looked at Ji Jiangran and said, \"Second Young Master Ji, as you wish, go and pay the bill. Don't let the beauty wait too long. Please let me stop and eat.\" Ji Jiangran would lose his grace if he continued to pester her. This was not his style. When I went to swipe my card, I was still thinking that this Gu Qianning used to be very clingy to him. He could see through her little thoughts at a glance, which made her extremely upset. Now that the situation has changed, she seems to have completely changed, and she has begun to turn a blind eye to him, which he can't let go of. On the way back, Yan Ruyu called him. I wanted to visit Ji's house in the evening and asked him: \"Jiang Ran, do you have time tonight? I'll go back with you.\" Ji Jiangran frowned, feeling upset, and said casually: \"I have a party tonight.\" Yan Ruyu knew the general rule well: \"Forget it, you are busy, I will go over to see my parents and have dinner with them in the evening.\" \"Okay.\" Ji Jiangran said simply and hung up the phone. Yan Ruyu was very popular in the Ji family. She had a sweet mouth and a sharp eye. She understood the essence of the upper class society thoroughly. Every time she went to Ji's house, she could make Jian Bai smile. She was sure that she was the definite daughter-in-law of Ji's family early on. Gu Qianning is far inferior to her in this regard. She used to be stupid. In simple words, she only has a good skin, but in fact she lacks a brain. Nowadays, there is no shortage of this, and it is cold. The main reason is that it leaves a bad impression, which makes it annoying no matter how you look at it. Gu Qianning ate lunch leisurely and went to the job market for a walk. I haven't decided what job I want to find yet, but I have an idea after taking a look at today's talent demand. It's really disappointing. With Gu Qianning's qualifications, no matter which company she goes to with her resume, she won't even be given a chance to interview. When we came out, it was almost three o'clock in the afternoon, and it looked like it was getting late. Called Mrs. Gu and urged her: \"Mom, are you leaving?\" Mrs. Gu hesitated; \"Qian Ning, mom can't go shopping with you this afternoon. Your sister is back from school... I have to stay at home with her...\" Gu Qian Ning was upset because she was left behind. The Gu family couldn't explain why, as if there was something fishy somewhere. However, the remaining impressions in Gu Qianning's mind did not identify these, so everything was vaguely unclear. She said coldly: \"I can't make it.\" Mrs. Gu could clearly tell that she was angry, and whispered: \"Mom will call you another day, and I will go to the mall to buy you some more clothes, and I will pay.\" When Gu Qianning went home, she first went to the supermarket to buy daily necessities and ingredients to fill the refrigerator. When she went back, she drove through the city center, and it was extremely congested. She stopped and walked, steering the wheel anxiously. Turn on the music casually, hold your head and listen quietly. Suddenly the car was hit and jerked forward. Gu Qianning took a look in the mirror and saw that a black car was obviously trying to overtake, but accidentally scratched the rear of her car. She drove the car to the side of the road, opened the door and got out. The owner of the black car also got out. He was very angry and arrogant. He pointed at Gu Qianning and scolded: \"You don't have eyes, do you?\" The man was tall and thick, with a red face and a thick neck. He was a bit scary. If it were an ordinary woman, she would not dare to speak out. After approaching, he asked Gu Qianning, \"How do you plan to compensate?\" Gu Qianning took a look at his car and saw that it was not too serious, except for scratching out a line of paint. Remind him: \"You were trying to overtake and hit me. The responsibility is not mine. How do you want me to compensate?\" A commercial vehicle stopped not far away. A kind-hearted driver saw the accident and came over to help. As he walked, he asked: \"What's wrong?\" The driver who caused the accident ignored him and stared straight-eyed: \"What did you say? Is it my responsibility? Are you a little girl blind?\" As he spoke, his fist was swung over and hit Gu Qianning. The man gasped and didn't wait to come closer to help. The driver who caused the accident had his arm gently held in Gu Qian Ningyun's hand. Her eyes flashed, and she smiled: \"Do you still want to do something? Impulse is the devil, and it's not good for you to do this.\" She spoke with a slight smile, and did not let go of the hand that held the driver responsible for the accident. She saw that the man gradually showed a painful and ferocious look, and his entire face gradually became distorted. He held back not making a sound, but his body bent down again and again, as if he was in unbearable pain, and his turbid breath blew out onto Gu Qianning's face. Gu Qianning laughed and snorted: \"So you were drunk, that's why you are so arrogant. I don't plan to compensate you a dime. Okay, let's call the police. Don't say that the responsibility is not on me. Even if it is really on me, the most severe thing is to fine me a few dollars. But you are a drunk driver. Administrative liability is different from criminal liability. Seeing that you drive such a good car, you must be good at acting like a dog. It is not good to have a black mark on your life.\" The driver who caused the accident was a little panicked. Moreover, the two cars had been parked for a long time, and including the car belonging to the kindhearted person, it was truly spectacular. I was afraid that the traffic police would be called over, so the atmosphere relaxed a bit and I knew I had to beg for mercy. \"Little girl, please let go first. We have something to talk about.\" Gu Qianning narrowed her eyes and said coolly: \"You refused when I wanted to talk to you, but now my aunt doesn't want to. Do you want to call the police or pay compensation?\" The driver who caused the accident nodded repeatedly: \"Compensation...you let me go first.\" The kind driver looked at the side curiously. Gu Qianning had a calm face. She didn't believe how strong a little girl was. Why did the man's face change? Gu Qianning threw his arm away and stretched out her hand: \"Bring it here.\" The driver's face suddenly changed, and he turned his face and didn't want to admit the blame. \"Don't even think about it.\" Gu Qianning slapped her backhand, already", "title_en": "Chapter 7"}